      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/e/9de053/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2013-10-23T18:58:32.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I'm not a costumer, but perhaps I could do a halloween-themed Sentinels game?&nbsp; Gloomweaver as the villain, obviously, and probably Tomb of Anubis for the environment (though Rook City is at least as frightening).&nbsp; But what heroes?&nbsp; About the only one that's at all scary is Visionary, and that's not in an especially Halloweeny way.&nbsp; I suppose the Wraith is obvious enough, and Nightmist, but beyond that I'm at a loss.</p>",
